  "details": "The issue I have is thus:\n\nMy avatar has a uniquely designed tail that closes around me gradually depending on how closed my fist is. Fully closed = fully wrapped around me, fully opened = behind my back, and, well: half-opened = half-wrapped. And so on gradually\n\nI could and played with this using my Oculus Touch controllers. However, Index controllers seem to work in binary, not gradual fashion when it comes to closed fist gesture override. Therefore, I can no longer half closer or play with my override anymore - I can either close or open the tail. That's it.\n\nIs there any possibility to override this behaviour somehow? I would love to have the ability to bind fist gesture override to the grip force sensor for example",
